BT /F1 17 Tf 0.0902 0.1961 0.3020 rg 1 0 0 1 65 184 Tm (GP22 drives Q2, which pulls Q1 base down through R1. Q1 then supplies the target. R2 and R4 default both transistors off.) Tj ET
BT /F1 17 Tf 0.0902 0.1961 0.3020 rg 1 0 0 1 65 160 Tm (R1 gives about 18 mA base drive to Q1; R3 draws about 2.5 mA from the Pico. Initial design load: up to 150 mA target current.) Tj ET
BT /F2 17 Tf 0.0902 0.1961 0.3020 rg 1 0 0 1 45 115 Tm (Check the loaded voltage at ZIF pin 33 before relying on this switch: aim for at least 4.5 V with the target running.) Tj ET
